# Auth & marketing surfaces

## Auth (`app/Authentication/`)
- Use `AuthPageShell` for Login, Signup, Forgot, Change password
- Set `Component.disableLayout = true` on the **page** or default export so CRM sidebar does not wrap auth
- Demo-only: validate client-side, toast “wire your auth provider” — no real sessions unless asked

## Agency site (`app/AgencySite/`)
- Shell: `AgencyShell` + `DynamicIslandNav`
- Config/copy: `agencyConfig.js` (checkout links, pricing tiers)
- Always `disableLayout = true`

## If adding a buyer SaaS marketing kit later
- Prefer a separate `/site/*` prefix so Agency sales pages stay intact
- Reuse auth components with `disableLayout`; do not nest auth inside CRM chrome for showcase flows
